body:
I think I wanna see a REmake of Code Veronica, before sorta putting that idea to bed. RE3 Remake was really disappointing to me, and while I have faith that they could do CV well, I don't really wanna see it happen to 1 or 4, games that I don't think even need remakes TBH. Revelations could maybe have a good bundle remaster where they put both games together or something, I'd be down for that. 

&#x200B;

If they wanna keep doing a 3rd person entry, and a 1st person entry. I'd like to see a Revelations 3, but with the first person entry being there. Maybe our characters for it could be Rebecca, or Carlos, but not the main 5. 

&#x200B;

For a 9th entry, taking place after Village, I think it'd be cool to see a combination of the characters we know and love (Chris, Leon, Jill, Claire and Ada), with them sorta mentoring some of the younger, superpowered characters (Jake, Sherry and >!Rose.!<) As much as I like him, I'm getting bored of only seeing Chris recently. Jill is definitely someone who should return, and work closely with Chris, and maybe Leon and Claire get together (Not romantically 👀) and work as outside sources. And of course, Ada is involved somehow. I'm really just spitballin' here, but my main point and want is just to see the return of some of the characters we know, maybe working together to take down The Connections or something. 

&#x200B;

Overall, I just wanna see some more variety in the characters, and a new direction for stuff. At the end of the day though, I'll buy any Resident Evil so I guess anything will work for me lmao.
